{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_014SFjDSGwgDyq21QP1bzqMn","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t//! Shared harness: loads BOTH the C `.so` and the Rust `.so` through\n2\t//! `libloading` and calls `dataentry` across the FFI boundary in both.\n3\t//!\n4\t//! The Rust implementation is *never* called directly — always via the\n5\t//! `cdylib`'s exported `dataentry` symbol, so the `#[no_mangle]`/`extern \"C\"`\n6\t//! wrapper is under test too.\n7\t\n8\tuse libloading::{Library, Symbol};\n9\tuse std::path::{Path, PathBuf};\n10\tuse std::process::Command;\n11\t\n12\tpub type DataEntryFn = unsafe extern \"C\" fn(\n13\t    ::std::os::raw::c_int,\n14\t    ::std::os::raw::c_int,\n15\t    ::std::os::raw::c_int,\n16\t    ::std::os::raw::c_int,\n17\t) -> ::std::os::raw::c_int;\n18\t\n19\tfn repo_root() -> PathBuf {\n20\t    // CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR == <root>/translation\n21\t    Path::new(env!(\"CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR\"))\n22\t        .parent()\n23\t        .expect(\"translation/ has a parent\")\n24\t        .to_path_buf()\n25\t}\n26\t\n27\t/// Build (if needed) and locate the C shared library.\n28\tfn c_so_path() -> PathBuf {\n29\t    let root = repo_root();\n30\t    let c_src = root.join(\"c_src\");"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d103381b-c775-4697-86e2-3aff4ae5b26b","uuid":"1fa4177f-097f-4940-b4e7-b66303965a9e","timestamp":"2026-09-05T13:59:37.693Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/local/home/scheschb/.harvest/work/harvest-work-g4xO1U/translation/tests/common/mod.rs","content":"//! Shared harness: loads BOTH the C `.so` and the Rust `.so` through\n//! `libloading` and calls `dataentry` across the FFI boundary in both.\n//!\n//! The Rust implementation is *never* called directly — always via the\n//! `cdylib`'s exported `dataentry` symbol, so the `#[no_mangle]`/`extern \"C\"`\n//! wrapper is under test too.\n\nuse libloading::{Library, Symbol};\nuse std::path::{Path, PathBuf};\nuse std::process::Command;\n\npub type DataEntryFn = unsafe extern \"C\" fn(\n    ::std::os::raw::c_int,\n    ::std::os::raw::c_int,\n    ::std::os::raw::c_int,\n    ::std::os::raw::c_int,\n) -> ::std::os::raw::c_int;\n\nfn repo_root() -> PathBuf {\n    // CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR == <root>/translation\n    Path::new(env!(\"CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR\"))\n        .parent()\n        .expect(\"translation/ has a parent\")\n        .to_path_buf()\n}\n\n/// Build (if needed) and locate the C shared library.\nfn c_so_path() -> PathBuf {\n    let root = repo_root();\n    let c_src = root.join(\"c_src\");","numLines":30,"startLine":1,"totalLines":278}}}
